# Terraform backend resources are bootstrapped outside the main state.
#
# Use backend-bootstrap.sh to create:
# - S3 bucket: cloudopshub-terraform-state-us-east-1
# - DynamoDB table: cloudopshub-terraform-locks
#
# This file is intentionally named .tf.example so Terraform does not try to
# manage the backend bucket/table from the same state that depends on them.
